        "entry_type": "ruled-out",
        "text": "**PlatformIO LDF Transitive Include**: Adding `BLEManager` to `[env:native].lib_deps` caused PlatformIO to attempt compiling non-native modules (`MCPServer.cpp`). Relying on PlatformIO's `chain+` mode with direct header includes in test suites (`#include \"BLEManager.hpp\"`) cleanly avoided this issue."
      }
